  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Municipal Development and Management in Gaza - SMDM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme&apos;s objective was to improve living conditions for the population in central Gaza through improved municipal services by addressing the acute demands in terms of social and physical infrastructure at municipal level. This was done through capacity building and projects. The programme encompassed 11 municipalities in central Gaza.

The programme consisted of three interlinked components: 1) institution and capacity building of the municipal administrations; 2) improvement of infrastructure; and 3) building of social infrastructure through projects involving municipalities and the population and income generating activities.</narrative>
  </description>
